      {
        "name": "places/ChIJlR9VkYn_AzQRfGsoTbv1IUg/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25oeVFsSnhWMUZKVG5GWE9VWlVhMUJVZUdScVNFRRAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "1 個月前",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": {
          "text": "環境溫馨服務好。368套餐抵食，白松露野菌湯濃郁，M3和牛西冷扒嫩滑。巴斯克芝士蛋糕同楓糖牛角包窩夫超好食，大推！",
          "languageCode": "zh-Hant"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "環境溫馨服務好。368套餐抵食，白松露野菌湯濃郁，M3和牛西冷扒嫩滑。巴斯克芝士蛋糕同楓糖牛角包窩夫超好食，大推！",
          "languageCode": "zh-Hant"
        },
        "authorAttribution": {
          "displayName": "Pinky Pinky (雅雅)",
          "uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108323775713986312543/reviews",
